  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6456f4dc26ba391f290f598e/step-f152a501.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain corn. Grate carrot. Using paper towel, squeeze out any moisture from the carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, combine corn, carrot, curry spice blend, veggie stock powder, shredded Cheddar, the plain flour, egg, the milk and a good pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6456f4dc26ba391f290f598e/step-ff94507f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat and add enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook heaped spoonfuls of fritter mixture, flattening with a spatula, until golden, 2-4 mins each side (don't flip too early!). Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Repeat with remaining fritter mixture. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6456f4dc26ba391f290f598e/step-ba347125.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato. In a medium bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves, and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season.\n• Divide fritters, potatoes and salad between plates. Serve with sweet chilli sauce and the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6456f4dc26ba391f290f598e/step-632928d5.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
